=== Culture and Background
<culture-and-background>
You may either choose the culture your character was raised with, or
roll and gain one blessing of Chaos.

- Gain 2 skill points in each of your culture's favored skills, these
  will be used to determine your total #strong[Skill Rank] later
- Write down your starting languages
- Note any additional traits
- Determine your character's exact birthplace from the options
  presented, either by roll or choice. This also includes the location
  on the map.

After this you may either choose your character's background, or roll on
your culture's background chart to gain another blessing of Chaos. Note
down how your character was raised and what skills they gain from this.
This does not have to favor one parent or another, and can also include
induction into a fraternal guild, adoption by another clan, or other
manner of relationship.

- Gain 6 skill points in each of these background skills

