=== Blessings of Chaos
<blessings-of-chaos>
=== Prepare for Adventure
<prepare-for-adventure>
Characters start with the fruits of their professions. Each skill in
which you have at least one rank grants additional equipment. Your
\[\[Game Rules/Adventuring/Hexcrawl\#^a2361e|carrying capacity\]\] is
half your strength score for items at hand, plus up to a number of items
equal to your full strength score carried in a pack. Additional items
may need to be stored at home. Details on items are under \[\[Game
Rules/Equipment|Equipment\]\]

Your character has a residence near where they are born. This is
unlikely to be freely owned property unless they are of exceptionally
high status. Most are shared with family, or could be a friendly
flophouse with sympathetic owner.

