=== Finalize Character Sheet
<finalize-character-sheet>
Additional languages equal to intelligence modifier

- AC = Brawl rank + Dexterity Modifier + bonus from worn armor
- Weapon Attack Bonus = corresponding fighting style rank + Strength
  modifier
  - Write To-Hit Threshold down as 11 - attack bonus
